#. ~ Description of "compact Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A small pistol accepting Glock magazines and chambered in 10mm.  Because of "
"its size, it is easy to carry, but it has rather fierce recoil."
msgstr ""
"Mały pistolet na magazynki Glock, kaliber 10 mm. Dzięki niewielkim rozmiarom "
"łatwo go nosić, ale ma dość silny odrzut."

