#. ~ Description of gun "firefly training pistol"
#. ~ Description of "firefly training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized, .22 caliber semi-automatic pistol, for training with a pistol"
" similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminum and polymer "
"components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is "
"not very powerful."
msgstr ""
"Średniej wielkości półautomatyczny pistolet kalibru .22, służący do treningu "
"z bronią podobną do silniejszych pistoletów. Zbudowany z aluminium i "
"polimerów jest lekki i łatwy do ukrycia, ale jego nabój nie jest zbyt silny."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "firefly training pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "firefly training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "GSG Firefly"
msgid_plural "GSG Fireflies"
msgstr[0] "GSG Firefly"
msgstr[1] "GSG Firefly"
msgstr[2] "GSG Firefly"
msgstr[3] "GSG Firefly"

#. ~ Description of variant "firefly training pistol" of gun "GSG Firefly"
#. ~ Description of variant "GSG Firefly" of item "firefly training pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"The GSG firefly is a .22 semi-automatic handgun.  While the GSG Firefly "
"started off as the SIG Mosquito, after the Mosquito ceased production, German"
" Sport Guns picked it up and renamed it to the Firefly."
msgstr ""
"GSG Firefly to półautomatyczny pistolet kalibru .22. Początkowo był to SIG "
"Mosquito, ale gdy zakończono produkcję Mosquito, przejęła go firma German "
"Sport Guns i zmieniła jego nazwę na Firefly."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
