#. ~ Description of "Ruger target pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A light and handy .22 LR handgun from Ruger, this handgun is one of the most "
"popular .22 handguns ever created."
msgstr ""
"Lekki i poręczny pistolet .22 LR firmy Ruger, jeden z najpopularniejszych "
"pistoletów .22, jakie kiedykolwiek powstały."

