msgstr[1] "karabiny dźwigniowe na drobną zwierzynę"
msgstr[2] "karabinów dźwigniowych na drobną zwierzynę"
msgstr[3] "karabinu dźwigniowego na drobną zwierzynę"

#. ~ Description of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "small game lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A .22 Long Rifle lever-action rifle, which holds 15 rounds of ammo.  While "
"quite useful against small game, its effectiveness isn't as great against the"
" undead."
msgstr ""
"Karabin kalibru .22 Long Rifle z zamkiem dźwigniowym, mieszczący 15 nabojów. "
"Choć jest całkiem przydatny przeciwko drobnej zwierzynie, przeciwko "
"nieumarłym nie jest już tak skuteczny."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "small game lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid "Rossi Rio Bravo"
msgid_plural "Rossi Rio Bravos"
msgstr[0] "Rossi Rio Bravo"
msgstr[1] "Rossi Rio Bravo"
msgstr[2] "Rossi Rio Bravo"
msgstr[3] "Rossi Rio Bravo"

#. ~ Description of variant "small game lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi Rio
#. Bravo"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi Rio Bravo" of item "small game lever-action
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Rio Bravo features an 18\" barrel "
"with 15 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded from the front "
"of the rifle.  The mechanical origins date back decades, being based off of "
"Rossi's R92 series of rifles which themselves were based off of the "
"Winchester 1892."
msgstr ""
"Współczesny karabin kalibru .22 LR z zamkiem dźwigniowym. Rio Bravo ma "
"18-calową lufę i 15 nabojów w magazynku rurowym ładowanym od przodu. Jego "
"mechanika sięga dziesięcioleci wstecz: oparto go na serii karabinów R92 firmy"
" Rossi, które z kolei wzorowano na Winchesterze 1892."

#. ~ Description of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "small game lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A .22 Long Rifle lever-action rifle, which holds 16 rounds of ammo.  While "
"quite useful against small game, its effectiveness isn't as great against the"
" undead."
msgstr ""
"Karabin kalibru .22 Long Rifle z zamkiem dźwigniowym, mieszczący 16 nabojów. "
"Choć jest całkiem przydatny przeciwko drobnej zwierzynie, przeciwko "
"nieumarłym nie jest już tak skuteczny."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
